<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><documents xmlns:xsi = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation = "HDocumentSchema.xsd"><document type = "H"><pnldref>H2918</pnldref><english><title>Use explosive / poison / electricity to take fish</title><additionalkeywords><additionalkeyword>USING</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>USED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>NOXIOUS SUBSTANCE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>ELECTRICAL DEVICE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>TAKING</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>TOOK</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>TAKEN</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>DESTROY</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>DESTROYED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>DESTRUCTION</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>DESTROYING</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>WATER</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>5</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>SALMON</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>FRESHWATER FISHERIES ACT</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>1975</additionalkeyword></additionalkeywords><standardoffencewording>On **(..SPECIFY DATE..) at **(..SPECIFY TOWNSHIP..) used in or near any waters (including waters adjoining the coast of England and Wales to a distance of 11,118m (6 nautical miles)),&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; (A)_[an explosive substance, namely **(..SPECIFY..),]_&lt;br /&gt; (B)_[a poison or other noxious substance, namely **(..SPECIFY..),]_&lt;br /&gt; (C)_[an electrical device, namely **(..SPECIFY..),]_&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; with intent thereby to take or destroy fish.</standardoffencewording><legislation>Contrary to section 5(1) of and Schedule 4 to the Salmon and Freshwater Fisheries Act 1975.</legislation><pointstoprove>date and location&lt;br /&gt; use in/near any water (including water adjoining coast of England and Wales to distance of 11 nautical&lt;br /&gt; miles) an explosive substance/poison/noxious substance/electrical device with intent to take/destroy fish</pointstoprove